# RUN: llc -mtriple=mncore2 %s -o - | FileCheck %s
#
# G0 on the Y face: the two faces are independent matrix registers with the
# same geometry, so Y must reproduce the X mapping exactly. Same pattern
# encoding as golden_mau_g0.mir (rows 0..3 only), read of column 0.
#
# Checker: scripts/check_mau_g0.py <dump> --case y

--- |
  target triple = "mncore2"
  define void @mau_g0_y() { ret void }
...
